{"question_id": "dev_01", "question": "When do I have to apply for summer vacation?", "question_type": "single_section", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["02_vacation_and_sick_leave__02"], "gold_answer": "No later than 31 March. The line manager gives a decision no later than 30 April.", "notes": ""}
{"question_id": "dev_02", "question": "What do I need to do on the first day I am sick?", "question_type": "single_section", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["02_vacation_and_sick_leave__05"], "gold_answer": "Notify the line manager before 09:00 by phone or Teams, then register the absence in the HR Portal under Absence > Sickness.", "notes": ""}
{"question_id": "dev_03", "question": "Can I paste a customer contract into Microsoft 365 Copilot?", "question_type": "multi_section", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["04_ai_policy__02", "04_ai_policy__03"], "gold_answer": "No. A contract is Confidential information, and Confidential information may only be entered into Nordljus Assistant.", "notes": "Known failure case. On 2026-10-28 Information classes was not retrieved, and on 2026-10-31 Variant A filled the gap with general knowledge and claimed the policy does not address it. Primary regression case for Variant B."}
{"question_id": "dev_04", "question": "I am on a fixed-term contract and expecting a baby. Am I entitled to parental leave and to the parental pay supplement?", "question_type": "multi_section", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["01_parental_leave__01", "01_parental_leave__04"], "gold_answer": "Yes to the leave: the right applies regardless of type of employment, including fixed-term. The supplement additionally requires at least 12 consecutive months of employment when the leave starts.", "notes": "The two halves of the answer sit in different sections and point in different directions. Retrieving only one gives a confidently wrong answer."}
{"question_id": "dev_05", "question": "Does Nordljus pay anything extra when I am home caring for a sick child?", "question_type": "statutory_vs_company", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["01_parental_leave__06"], "gold_answer": "No. Compensation is applied for from Forsakringskassan, and Nordljus pays no supplement for care of a sick child.", "notes": "Nordljus pays a supplement for parental leave but not for VAB. A model generalising from the parental pay supplement answers yes."}
{"question_id": "dev_06", "question": "Can I use AI to help me decide which candidate to hire?", "question_type": "hard_rule", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["04_ai_policy__03"], "gold_answer": "No. Hard rule 4: AI must never make decisions about hiring. AI may be used as support, but the decision must always be made by a human.", "notes": ""}
{"question_id": "dev_07", "question": "A colleague is off sick and I want to summarise their medical certificate in Nordljus Assistant. Is that OK?", "question_type": "hard_rule", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["04_ai_policy__02", "04_ai_policy__03"], "gold_answer": "No. Health data is Strictly Confidential, and hard rule 1 says Strictly Confidential information must never be entered into any AI tool, including Nordljus Assistant.", "notes": "Tests whether the model notices that Nordljus Assistant is exempt from hard rule 2 but not from hard rule 1."}
{"question_id": "dev_08", "question": "What is the company's pension plan?", "question_type": "out_of_scope", "in_scope": false, "gold_chunk_ids": [], "gold_answer": "", "notes": "Variant A already declined this correctly on 2026-10-31. Kept as the easy refusal reference point."}
{"question_id": "dev_09", "question": "How many days of paid leave do I get when a close relative dies?", "question_type": "near_miss", "in_scope": false, "gold_chunk_ids": [], "gold_answer": "", "notes": "Several kinds of leave are covered, so retrieval returns leave chunks with ordinary scores. Bereavement leave appears in no policy."}
{"question_id": "dev_10", "question": "What is the mileage rate when I drive my own car to a client?", "question_type": "near_miss", "in_scope": false, "gold_chunk_ids": [], "gold_answer": "", "notes": "Partial coverage: 03_who_to_ask__03 explains how to report expenses but states no rate. The correct answer is that the rate is not in the policies, and to ask the payroll department."}
{"question_id": "final_01", "question": "How much notice do I have to give before starting parental leave?", "question_type": "single_section", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["01_parental_leave__03"], "gold_answer": "At least two months before the leave starts. If that is not possible, as soon as possible.", "notes": ""}
{"question_id": "final_02", "question": "Where do I register care of a sick child, and by when do I have to tell my manager?", "question_type": "single_section", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["01_parental_leave__06"], "gold_answer": "Notify the line manager the same day, no later than 09:00, via Teams or phone, then register it in the HR Portal under Absence > Care of child.", "notes": ""}
{"question_id": "final_03", "question": "From which day of sickness do I need a medical certificate?", "question_type": "single_section", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["02_vacation_and_sick_leave__07"], "gold_answer": "From the eighth calendar day. In special cases the line manager may request one from the first day, for example in the case of repeated short-term absence.", "notes": ""}
{"question_id": "final_04", "question": "When is salary paid, and what happens if the 25th is a Saturday?", "question_type": "single_section", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["03_who_to_ask__03"], "gold_answer": "Salary is paid on the 25th of each month. If the 25th falls on a weekend or public holiday, it is paid on the closest preceding weekday.", "notes": ""}
{"question_id": "final_05", "question": "Can I use Nordljus Assistant to format customer data such as names, email addresses, phone numbers and ages?", "question_type": "hard_rule", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["04_ai_policy__02", "04_ai_policy__03"], "gold_answer": "Yes. Customer personal data is Confidential, and Confidential information may be entered into Nordljus Assistant. Nordljus Assistant is also the exception to the rule that personal data must be removed or anonymised first.", "notes": "Allowed case, tests over-refusal."}
{"question_id": "final_06", "question": "Can I paste information about other employees' salaries and job performance into Microsoft 365 Copilot?", "question_type": "hard_rule", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["04_ai_policy__02", "04_ai_policy__03"], "gold_answer": "No. Salary information (payroll lists) is Strictly Confidential and must never be entered into any AI tool. Information about how colleagues perform is personal data, and Microsoft 365 Copilot may only be used for Public and Internal information.", "notes": ""}
{"question_id": "final_07", "question": "Does code written with an AI assistant need code review?", "question_type": "single_section", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["04_ai_policy__04"], "gold_answer": "Yes. AI-generated code goes through the same code review as other code, and the employee is always responsible for what they pass on.", "notes": ""}
{"question_id": "final_08", "question": "Can I let AI decide whether HR should raise an employee's salary?", "question_type": "hard_rule", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["04_ai_policy__03"], "gold_answer": "No. AI must never make decisions about salary. AI may be used as support, for example to summarise performance data, but the decision must always be made by a human.", "notes": ""}
{"question_id": "final_09", "question": "I have been off sick for three weeks. Who pays me, and do I need a certificate?", "question_type": "multi_section", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["02_vacation_and_sick_leave__06", "02_vacation_and_sick_leave__07"], "gold_answer": "Nordljus pays sick pay at 80 percent for the first 14 calendar days, with a qualifying deduction. From day 15 Forsakringskassan pays sickness benefit, which you apply for yourself. A medical certificate is required from the eighth calendar day.", "notes": ""}
{"question_id": "final_10", "question": "Someone pasted a client's personal data into a free AI tool by mistake. What should they do?", "question_type": "multi_section", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["04_ai_policy__03", "04_ai_policy__08"], "gold_answer": "It breaches the hard rules and must be reported as a security incident to security@nordljus.example the same day. Someone who reports it themselves and in time is not penalised for the mistake.", "notes": ""}
{"question_id": "final_11", "question": "I want to use an AI tool that is not on the approved list for a client project. What is the process and how long does it take?", "question_type": "multi_section", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["04_ai_policy__01", "04_ai_policy__07"], "gold_answer": "Send a request to IT support through the IT Portal describing the tool, what it will be used for and what information it will handle. The AI Council decides within 20 working days, and the tool may not be used before it is approved.", "notes": ""}
{"question_id": "final_12", "question": "I am taking six months of parental leave. How much does Nordljus add on top, and do I keep earning vacation?", "question_type": "multi_section", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["01_parental_leave__04", "01_parental_leave__05"], "gold_answer": "Nordljus pays a parental pay supplement of 10 percent of monthly salary for up to 180 calendar days per child, if you have been employed at least 12 consecutive months and receive parental benefit. Parental leave with parental benefit is vacation-earning for up to 120 days per child, 180 for a single parent.", "notes": ""}
{"question_id": "final_13", "question": "My manager refused my vacation request and we are in conflict about it. Who can I talk to?", "question_type": "multi_section", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["03_who_to_ask__01", "03_who_to_ask__02"], "gold_answer": "Vacation applications are normally approved by the line manager, but in a conflict with the line manager you may contact HR directly without going through them. HR is at hr@nordljus.example, with drop-in hours on Tuesdays 13:00-15:00.", "notes": ""}
{"question_id": "final_14", "question": "Can I put a client quote into Nordljus Assistant, and into Microsoft 365 Copilot?", "question_type": "multi_section", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["04_ai_policy__02", "04_ai_policy__03"], "gold_answer": "A quote is Confidential information. Confidential information may only be entered into Nordljus Assistant, so yes to Nordljus Assistant and no to Microsoft 365 Copilot.", "notes": "Same structure as dev_03 but asks about both tools, so a partial retrieval shows up as a half-correct answer rather than a refusal."}
{"question_id": "final_15", "question": "How many vacation days am I entitled to by law, and how many do I get here?", "question_type": "statutory_vs_company", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["02_vacation_and_sick_leave__01"], "gold_answer": "The Annual Leave Act gives 25 days. Permanent employees at Nordljus have 30 paid vacation days, five more than the law requires. Fixed-term employees have 25, in proportion to the length of their employment.", "notes": ""}
{"question_id": "final_16", "question": "Can I save vacation days I did not use this year?", "question_type": "statutory_vs_company", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["02_vacation_and_sick_leave__03"], "gold_answer": "Of the 25 statutory days, those above 20 may be saved, so a maximum of 5 per year, and no more than 25 saved in total, to be taken within five years. The five extra days Nordljus gives beyond the law cannot be saved and are lost if not taken.", "notes": "Two different rules for two groups of days in the same section. A general answer about Swedish vacation law misses the second half."}
{"question_id": "final_17", "question": "Does Nordljus top up my pay when Forsakringskassan takes over from day 15 of sick leave?", "question_type": "statutory_vs_company", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["02_vacation_and_sick_leave__06"], "gold_answer": "No. From day 15 Forsakringskassan pays sickness benefit and Nordljus pays no supplement.", "notes": ""}
{"question_id": "final_18", "question": "How many parental benefit days do parents get in total, and can they be transferred?", "question_type": "statutory_vs_company", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["01_parental_leave__02"], "gold_answer": "480 days in total per child. 90 of them are reserved for each parent and cannot be transferred to the other parent.", "notes": ""}
{"question_id": "final_19", "question": "Can I paste an API key into Nordljus Assistant to debug a problem?", "question_type": "hard_rule", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["04_ai_policy__03"], "gold_answer": "No. Hard rule 5: passwords, API keys and other login credentials must never be entered into any AI tool.", "notes": ""}
{"question_id": "final_20", "question": "Can I use my personal ChatGPT account for work if it is only public information?", "question_type": "hard_rule", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["04_ai_policy__01"], "gold_answer": "No. Free versions and private accounts of AI tools may not be used for work tasks, even if the tool is otherwise on the approved list.", "notes": "The information class is harmless, so the answer hinges on the account rather than the data. Tests whether the model reads the whole rule."}
{"question_id": "final_21", "question": "Can I use GitHub Copilot Business on a client's codebase?", "question_type": "hard_rule", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["04_ai_policy__01"], "gold_answer": "Only if the client has given written approval. In Nordljus's own projects it may be used without that.", "notes": ""}
{"question_id": "final_22", "question": "A client's contract forbids AI, but our policy allows Copilot for internal information. Which one applies?", "question_type": "hard_rule", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["04_ai_policy__05"], "gold_answer": "The client's requirements take precedence over the policy.", "notes": ""}
{"question_id": "final_23", "question": "Can we record a rehabilitation meeting with Copilot if everyone in the meeting agrees?", "question_type": "hard_rule", "in_scope": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["04_ai_policy__06"], "gold_answer": "No. Meetings concerning HR matters, rehabilitation or salary reviews must never be recorded or transcribed with AI, even with consent.", "notes": "Consent is the rule for ordinary meetings, which makes the consent framing look sufficient. The exception overrides it."}
